131	    /**
132	     * Handles {@link InvalidTelephoneException} thrown while normalizing a telephone number into
133	     * E.164 form, returning a 400 Bad Request so a number that cannot form a valid E.164 value is
134	     * rejected rather than surfacing as an unexpected 500.
