168	     * Handles {@link InvalidAddressException} thrown when an owner request supplies no usable
169	     * postal address in either accepted form (neither a non-blank structured {@code addressLine1}
170	     * nor a non-blank flat {@code address}), returning a 400 Bad Request so a missing address is
171	     * rejected rather than surfacing as an unexpected 500.
